restart.txt

# Subagent scratch reports written into the repo root during
# subagent-driven development. The durable record is the commit history
# and docs/superpowers/. A leading dot does not stop `git add` sweeping
# them up, so ignore the pattern explicitly.
/*-report.md
/.*-report.md
/*.diff
